**Requires Provider Cooperation (Not Available for v1):**
- ❌ Claude.ai subscription login (no public API)
- ❌ ChatGPT SSO with auto-generated keys (Codex-specific)
- ❌ Team-managed workspace keys (requires EPAM platform backend enhancements)

